    "title": "Mandolin Tremolo Study",
    "author": "Atomik",
    "notes": "Sixteenth notes on one note a bar with the downbeat accented, then the same notes as long tremolo notes. Pick from the wrist and let the pairs of strings ring. Open the clip in the Tab Editor (View > Editors > Tab Editor), loop a few bars and slow it down with the practice bar."
